00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:24.330
<b>The Swimmers of Kamogawa{OR just Kamogawa Swimmers}</b>

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:25.660
<b>Let me introduce the new transfer student.</b>

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.580
<b>Muginami</b>

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:26.910
<b>Is she foreign?</b>

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.580
<b>A transfer student?</b>

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.580
<b>She's cute!</b>

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.580
<b>I'm Muginami!</b>

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.880
<b>Due to unfortunate family circumstances,</b>

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:36.920
<b>she will be attending school here for a while.</b>

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.220
<b>I'm Muginami!</b>

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:40.050
<b>She'll be coming to class in her regular clothes</b>

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.680
<b>until her school uniform is ready.</b>

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.100
<b>She's lived abroad for some time</b>

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.850
<b>and her grasp of our language may be a little awkward,</b>

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.220
<b>but please be nice to her.</b>

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.270
<b>I'm Muginami!</b>

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:49.640
<b>Our school is so lax!</b>

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.730
<b>I heard that, Nogami.</b>

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.230
<b>Let's see, where should you sit?</b>

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.240
<b>Oh, I guess you can sit next to Kyouno.</b>

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.700
<b><i>So anyway,</i></b>

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:05.700
<b>Umm...</b>

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.660
<b><i>can you girls help her out later</i></b>

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.160
<b>Have we met before?</b>

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.460
<b><i>by showing her around the campus and answer any questions</i></b>

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.670
<b><i>she might have about this school.</i></b>

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.620
<b>Now that you mention it, I think so...</b>

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.250
<b>I'm sorry, my mistake.</b>

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:16.840
<b>Oh...</b>

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.630
<b>I'm Muginami!</b>

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.140
<b>Nice to meet you...</b>

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.720
<b>Miss Kyouno Madoka.</b>

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.390
<b>What the hell was the Security Team doing?</b>

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:37.570
<b>How did this girl manage to get into the Vox hangar?</b>

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:47.660
<b>She actually transferred into Miss Madoka's school.</b>

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.160
<b>What an unexpected turn of events.</b>

