00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:20.070
<b>"A student of Kamo Girls' must not forget about war during peacetime."</b>

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.150
<b>"Likewise, they must not forget about peace during wartime."</b>

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.910
<b>Is that the school motto? Sounds more like the army.</b>

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.370
<b>What was the name of that girl who hung around Madoka? Muginami?</b>

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:30.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.660
<b>You're going to just let her roam free?</b>

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.460
<b>It's a matter of viewpoint.</b>

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.500
<b>I'd rather think that we're keeping her under surveillance until she shows her true colors.</b>

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:43.380
<b><i>Kyouno Madoka from Class 2-3.</i></b>

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.220
<b><i>Please come to the school reception office.</i></b>

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.470
<b>Huh? Me?</b>

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.470
<b><i>Kyouno Madoka from Class 2-3.</i></b>

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.350
<b><i>Please come to the school reception office.</i></b>

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:50.930
<b>Kamo Girls!</b>

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.850
<b>Fight, fight, fight, fight!</b>

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:54.560
<b>What?!</b>

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.650
<b>Kyouno was the one fighting inside that robot?!</b>

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.650
<b>Ms. Iwabuchi, not so loud.</b>

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.320
<b>How can I stay calm?</b>

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:06.410
<b>What do you think you're doing to one of my students?!</b>

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.250
<b>I don't know what kind of organization you're supposed to represent,</b>

