00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:15.370
<b>Syouzo\h\h\h\hTadokoro</b>

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.370
<b>but you're out of your mind!</b>

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.250
Kamogawa Girls' High School Policies

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.000
<b>Nowhere in our school regulation does it state that</b>

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.380
<b>a student is allowed to fight inside a robot.</b>

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.380
<b>Nor does it say that they're forbidden from doing so.</b>

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.890
<b>Don't tell me you agreed to this.</b>

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.890
<b>She decided to do it herself.</b>

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.600
<b>Youko...</b>

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:41.570
<b>Actually, Miss Nakaizumi ultimately persuaded</b>

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:44.650
<b>Miss Kyouno into making her final decision.</b>

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.450
<b>How do you know all of this?</b>

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.360
<b>You said so on the cell phone—!</b>

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.370
<b>You were eavesdropping on our conversation?</b>

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.670
<b>No... well... um...</b>

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.380
<b>Youko's right.</b>

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.300
<b>It was my decision to pilot Midori.</b>

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:04.760
<b>Kyouno...</b>

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:05.960
<b>Midori?</b>

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:08.430
<b>It's the name I gave to that robot.</b>

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.550
<b>It's cute and easy to remember, don't you think?</b>

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.640
<b>Now hold on. Don't go giving it weird names.</b>

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.600
<b>The official denomination of that craft is Vox Aura—</b>

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.730
<b>Keep your mouth shut.</b>

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:24.780
<b>But if the aliens are after this robot,</b>

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.570
<b>wouldn't handing it over to them solve the problem?</b>

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.450
<b>Mr. Tadokoro, you may speak now.</b>

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.000
<b>Well, long story short...</b>

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.750
<b>They don't just want possession of the Vox.</b>

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:48.010
<b>They intend to use Vox's power to conquer other planets.</b>

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:51.300
<b>Naturally, Earth is no exception.</b>

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.430
<b>So that's why you'll fight?</b>

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.050
<b>Yes.</b>

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.970
<b>You expect me to believe such an outrageous story?</b>

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.310
<b>Whether you believe me or not, {this and next line need retiming}</b>

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:03.270
<b>{TIMING "Kamogawa ga"}the fact is that Kamogawa was attacked and Kyouno saved it.</b>

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:07.230
<b>Looks like we're thrown into this so-called interstellar war</b>

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.490
<b>whether we like it or not.</b>

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.990
<b>Youko...</b>

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.660
<b>Oh yeah! Why didn't I think of that option?</b>

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:15.030
<b>What...?</b>

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.240
<b>...option? {make the lines appear in the right order please, timer-kun}</b>

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:19.620
<b>I won't have to fight if we hand over Midori?</b>

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.080
<b>You're unbelievable...</b>

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.210
<b>Huh? Huh?</b>

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.750
<b>Kyouno, are you really okay with this?</b>

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:31.630
<b>Yes.</b>

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:36.970
<b>If you ask me, I don't think Madoka can bear such a heavy responsibility.</b>

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:40.230
<b>She can barely run the Jersey Club as things are now.</b>

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.480
<b>Youko!</b>

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:44.900
<b>But wouldn't it be fun if we used this opportunity</b>

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:48.610
<b>{TIMING uchuu debut}to make a big space debut for the Kamo Girls' Jersey Club?</b>

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:49.990
<b>Space...?</b>

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:51.360
<b>...debut? {same deal here}</b>

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.160
<b>Now that's an idea.</b>

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:54.820
<b>All right then!</b>

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.290
<b>Kyouno, if you've really made up your mind, then go for it, girl!</b>

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:02.000
<b>Show those aliens some Jersey Club spirit!</b>

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.080
<b>Right!</b>

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.290
<b>But on one condition.</b>

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:07.960
<b>What?</b>

