00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.550
<b>Madoka, you're going for the win this year, right?</b>

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:57.890
<b>Hmm... we'll see. Maybe if I'm lucky.</b>

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:01.680
<b>Man! If only I had my surfboard, I would've stolen the show!</b>

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.430
<b>Too bad surfing isn't included in the national sports competitions.</b>

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:10.730
<b>So you ended up accepting Nakaizumi Youko's condition?</b>

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.110
<b>But on one condition.</b>

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:16.860
<b>What?</b>

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:22.160
<b>Madoka will continue to live at home and attend this school.</b>

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.870
<b>That's two conditions!</b>

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.580
<b>You're in no position to quibble, mister!</b>

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.580
<b>Oww!{overlap}</b>

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.420
<b>Damn it!</b>

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:34.210
<b>I hear it's a school tradition held since the school's founding,</b>

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:36.220
<b>but it looks more like a festival out there.</b>

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.220
<b>Why organize it now, though?</b>

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.800
<b>It's not like the ocean's going anywhere.</b>

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.930
<b>I think it's nice that they're trying to make things fun and exciting.</b>

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.060
<b>I like it.</b>

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:48.600
<b>You sure it's not the girls in swimsuits that are getting you excited, Jim?</b>

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.730
<b>I bet you're recording this feed, right?</b>

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.860
<b>What? No, that's not...</b>

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.070
<b>Eww, pervert!</b>

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.150
<b>You're wrong!</b>

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:59.200
<b>I don't even collect girl figurines!</b>

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:04.490
<b>Uehara, is the contingency plan to evacuate the pilot ready?</b>

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:08.620
<b>Yes, sir. Coordination between all relevant organizations have been checked and cleared.</b>

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:09.670
<b>Good.</b>

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:13.670
<b>James, playback the video from five seconds ago.</b>

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:14.550
<b>Huh?</b>

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:15.260
<b>Hurry!</b>

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.420
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.430
<b>Pause right there!</b>

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:27.180
<b>Not her! Zoom in on the lower left!</b>

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.570
<b>Is that Laffinty?</b>

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.400
<b>It appears so.</b>

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:40.660
<b><i>Milady, what are you doing there?</i></b>

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.030
<b>I'm looking after Madoka.</b>

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:44.200
<b>Here she comes.</b>

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.830
<b>I'm sorry I'm late.</b>

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.710
<b>Wow!</b>

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:04.890
<b>Ready...</b>

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:20.900
<b>All right! Go!</b>

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:20.490
<b>The swimmers are off to a strong start!</b>

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.070
<b>The 86th Annual Kamogawa...</b>

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.070
<b>Go for it!</b>

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:45.140
<b>Muginami is such a good swimmer!</b>

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.970
<b>Wow, check her out.</b>

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.680
<b>She's keeping up with Madoka!</b>

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.870
<b><i>That girl... She's the princess of Le Garite!</i></b>

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:50.450
<b>Someone help!</b>

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:00.920
<b>You're kidding.</b>

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.760
<b>Don't tell me...she really can't swim?</b>

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:04.800
<b>I'm coming!</b>

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.520
<b><i>At this rate, I'll be pulled down too.</i></b>

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:35.910
<b>Hang in there!</b>

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.220
<b><i>She's...!</i></b>

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:09.860
<b>She'll be all right.</b>

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.570
<b>Thank goodness, Lan!</b>

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.620
<b>Madoka...</b>

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.170
<b><i>Their Memoria... So that's where they have it.</i></b>

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.340
<b>Coming in first place is Miss Ikuta Kanae from Class 2-2.</b>

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.810
<b>In second place is Miss Takashiro Azumi from Class 3-1.</b>

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.560
<b>You were so close to winning.</b>

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:40.850
<b>Finally in third place,</b>

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.730
<b>What a shame.</b>

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.480
<b>Miss Tamaki Eriko from Class 2-2.</b>

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:45.320
<b>But I got to find out something great in exchange.</b>

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:46.190
<b>Say, Muginami!</b>

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.030
<b>Want to come over to my house?{you gonna get taken home}</b>

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:48.780
<b>Huh?</b>

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.870
<b><i>Thank goodness you're all right.</i></b>

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.830
<b><i>I was worried after hearing that you almost drowned.</i></b>

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.290
<b>Don't worry. I'm okay now.</b>

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:19.730
<b>Souta.</b>

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:21.980
<b>Souta!</b>

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:23.900
<b>Youko!</b>

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.020
<b>Whoa!</b>

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.360
<b>The guys here don't know what they're doing.</b>

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.450
<b>They handle artifacts carelessly,</b>

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.240
<b>and the way they catalogue items is totally disorganized.</b>

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:37.870
<b>They're worse than amateurs when it comes to archaeology.</b>

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.160
<b>Who the hell are they, then?</b>

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.960
<b>They are all people who specialize in</b>

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.800
<b>mechanical or electrical hardware engineering.</b>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:49.960
<b>Take a look at this.</b>

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:55.680
<b>What they have here aren't just the artifacts we excavated in Kamogawa.</b>

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:00.600
<b>This one was discovered at the bottom of the Atlantic Ocean near Bermuda.</b>

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.560
<b>And this was found in the Indian Ocean near Madagascar.</b>

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:08.070
<b>Ignis represents fire...</b>

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:10.070
<b>Lympha represents water...</b>

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.400
<b>And Madoka's Aura represents wind, huh?</b>

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.540
<b>The Jersey Club?</b>

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.170
<b>Yes, will you join?</b>

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:27.000
<b>I've been waiting for someone just like you!</b>

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:31.800
<b>But I don't quite understand what you do there.</b>

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.760
<b>I'll explain it to you if you agree to join!</b>

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:38.760
<b>See, it's more about being a comrade than a club member.</b>

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.470
<b>A comrade?</b>

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:43.390
<b>Yeah, people who share the same feelings.</b>

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.270
<b>Comrade...{Lan channeling that inner homuhomu stalkin'}</b>

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:50.020
<b>I feel like you and I can become great comrades.</b>

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:53.950
<b>You're a great swimmer and your rescuing skills were amazing!</b>

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.280
<b>Comrades, huh?</b>

00:16:58.780 --> 00:16:59.830
<b>Sure!</b>

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.290
<b>Muginami will join the Jersey Club!</b>

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.460
<b>Really? Yes!</b>

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.580
<b>Our very first Jersey Club member!</b>

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.540
<b>I'll learn how to swim too!</b>

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.960
<b>When did you get here, Lan?</b>

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.670
<b>She's been here for a while.</b>

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:17.180
<b>Here you go.</b>

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.220
<b>Oh, it looks delicious!</b>

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.560
<b>It's to celebrate you joining the club.</b>

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:22.220
<b>Welcome.</b>

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.140
<b>Thanks to you, Muginami,</b>

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.020
<b>I can finally show Youko who's boss!</b>

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.270
<b>It would've been great if Lan were also a student at our school.</b>

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:34.360
<b>Welcome.</b>

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.450
<b>Excuse me!</b>

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.030
<b>Oh, one moment please.</b>

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.320
<b>We'll have two Sangayaki Burgers.</b>

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.490
<b>It's starting to get crowded.</b>

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.450
<b>Sure thing.</b>

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.460
<b>I'll help!</b>

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.470
<b>Please enjoy.</b>

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:01.100
<b>Over at BWH right now.\h
The waitress is super cute!</b>

