<b>Here's the order.</b>

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.230
<b>Coming right up!</b>

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.400
<b>Business is booming thanks to her.</b>

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.160
<b>You think she'd be interested in working here part-time?</b>

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.210
<b>Here you...</b>

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.670
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.840
<b>I-I'll get a towel...</b>

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.000
<b>Lan...</b>

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:36.970
<b>She's a klutz.</b>

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.380
<b>A klutzy waitress... I like it!</b>

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:41.430
<b>They have a cute and klutzy waitress!!</b>

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.300
<b>I'll take your plates away.</b>

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.480
<b>Madoka, do you think she'd be interested in working here part-time too?</b>

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.370
<b>Sorry for making you both help out until closing time.</b>

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.460
<b>Not at all. It was fun.</b>

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:14.880
<b>I'm so terrible... I'm so terrible at everything.</b>

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.170
<b>So terrible...</b>

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.260
<b>Uncle...{overlap}</b>

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.300
<b>Can you give them a ride home?</b>

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.300
<b>So, so, terrible...{overlap}</b>

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:21.010
<b>Sure thing.</b>

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:26.140
<b>Um, I... have no place to...</b>

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:29.060
<b>Oh... Hmm...</b>

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:34.110
<b>Say Muginami, would you like to live here with me?{she got taken home}</b>

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:37.780
<b>Is that okay, Uncle?</b>

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:38.610
<b>Sure.</b>

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:42.070
<b>Huh? Are you sure?</b>

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:46.030
<b>I have millions of rooms to spare!</b>

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:51.120
<b>I'm so happy! Thank you, Madoka!</b>

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:52.670
<b>Sure! It's my pleasure!</b>

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.460
<b>Easy, Muginami! I can't breathe.</b>

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.540
<b>That's so...{overlap}</b>

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.770
<b>The head of Kiss comes to meet us in person?</b>

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.180
<b>Villagiulio...</b>

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.600
<b>Were you the one who struck our ship?!</b>

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.520
<b>Say, schoolboys...</b>

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:20.150
<b>Would you be interested in teaming up with me?</b>

